# Admin Assets

## JavaScript (`admin/js/edminboost-admin.js`)

- Wrap in an IIFE with `'use strict'`.
- Guard on `window.edminboostData` before running.
- Scope DOM queries to `.edminboost-wrap` or plugin-specific selectors.
- No jQuery unless WordPress already loads it for the screen.
- Use `DOMContentLoaded` for initialization.
- On `DOMContentLoaded`, call `initCommandCenterNav()`, `initPickerCloseOnScroll()`, `reinitEdminboostPage( root )`, and `primeCommandCenterHistory()`.
- `reinitEdminboostPage( root )` sets `data-edminboost-ready="true"` and runs all page inits — also called after CC tab AJAX swaps.
- Page-specific init functions: `initCommandCenterNav` (CC tab AJAX nav), `initSetupWizard` (Dashboard first-run wizard), `initLayoutPresetPicker` (setup wizard + Layout Presets + Dashboard overview compact picker), `initDashboardOverview` (post-setup overview inline save), `initMapper`, `initMenuStudio`, `initBehavior` (Appearance page), `initTheme`, `initPresets` (Layout Presets actions), `initCommandCenterForms`, `initSettingsForm` — each no-ops if target elements are absent.
- `initBehavior` delegates to `initBehaviorBadgePreview` (toggle badge style previews), `initBehaviorDrawerWidthCustom` (custom width slider + live preview), and `initBehaviorAnimationSpeed` (animation speed listbox + drawer micro-previews).

`edminboostData` shape:

```javascript
{
	version: string,
	currentPage: string,
	optionName: 'edminboost_settings',
	strings: {
		ready, configureItem, removeFromTopBar, emptyCanvas, exportSuccess,
		customLinkPathRequired, customLinkLabelRequired, customLinkPathInvalid,
		customLinkAnchorInvalid, customLinkDuplicate, drawerPreviewFailed,
		drawerWidthPreviewCaption, settingsSaved, settingsSaveFailed,
		presetApplied, presetNameRequired, presetSaved, presetDuplicated, skinSaved,
		emptyMenuCanvas, removeFromSidebar, customMenuPathRequired, customMenuLabelRequired,
		customMenuPathInvalid, customMenuDuplicate, selectLayoutPreset, saveAndLaunch,
		presetBadgeBuiltIn, presetBadgeSaved, presetBadgeVirtual, emptyLayoutPreview,
		pageLoading, pageLoadFailed
	},
	presets: object,          // resolved preset layouts for JS (from get_picker_presets)
	presetCategories: object, // category labels from EDMINBOOST_Command_Center::get_preset_categories()
	themePresets: object,     // from EDMINBOOST_Theme::get_presets_for_js()
	themeColorLabels: object, // from EDMINBOOST_Theme::get_color_labels()
	settingsSave: { ajaxUrl, action: 'edminboost_save_settings' },
	ccNav: {                   // CC tab navigation without full reload
		ajaxUrl, action: 'edminboost_load_cc_page', nonce
	},
	lookSkins: object,        // from EDMINBOOST_Command_Center::get_look_skins()
	drawerPreview: {          // Layout Studio only
		ajaxUrl, action: 'edminboost_cc_drawer_preview', nonce
	}
}
```

## Command Center bar JS (`admin/js/edminboost-command-center-bar.js`)

- Separate from plugin-screen `edminboost-admin.js` — enqueued only when the live bar has drawer items.
- Wrap in an IIFE with `'use strict'`; guard on `window.edminboostCcBar.drawerItems`.
- Requires `#edminboost-cc-drawer` shell from `render_drawer_shell()`.

`edminboostCcBar` shape:

```javascript
{
	drawerItems: {
		'edminboost-cc-{hash}': { slug, label, frameUrl, openUrl }
	},
	animationMs: number,  // from behavior animation_speed
	iframeTitle: string   // accessible iframe label
}
```

- Opens drawer on `#wpadminbar .edminboost-cc-bar-drawer-trigger > .ab-item` click; closes on backdrop, close button, or Escape.
- Reuses server-rendered iframes via `frameCache`; prefetches on admin-bar hover (`mouseover`); resolves node IDs with or without `wp-admin-bar-` prefix.
- Sets iframe `src` to signed `frameUrl`; shows loading overlay until `iframe.onload`.
- Exposes `window.edminboostCcOpenDrawer( { label, frameUrl, openUrl } )` for Layout Studio preview (mapper enqueues this script even without live drawer items).

## CSS

### Plugin screens (`admin/css/edminboost-admin.css`)

- Prefix all selectors with `.edminboost-` to avoid admin conflicts.
- Layout: `.edminboost-wrap`, `.edminboost-dashboard`, `.edminboost-card`, `.edminboost-status`.
- Dashboard: `.edminboost-home-wrap` (+ `.edminboost-home-wrap--wizard` before setup), `.edminboost-home-hero`, `.edminboost-dashboard-overview`, `.edminboost-overview-grid`, `.edminboost-overview-card`, `.edminboost-overview-card__preview`.
- Overview previews: `.edminboost-overview-theme-preview` (+ `__bar`, `__layout`, `__sidebar`, `__main`, `__accent`, `__line`, `__swatches`, `__swatch`), `.edminboost-overview-topbar-preview` (+ `__canvas`, `__brand`, `__items`, `__item`, `__badge`, `__more`, `__profile`, `--empty`).
- Overview pickers: `.edminboost-overview-theme-picker`, `.edminboost-overview-topbar-links-picker` (+ `__toggle`, `__label`, `__list`, `__option`, `__option-main`, `__option-name`, `__option-meta`, `__empty`).
- CC tab loading: `.edminboost-cc-nav.is-loading`, `.edminboost-wrap.is-cc-loading`.
- Setup wizard: `.edminboost-setup-wizard`, `.edminboost-setup-stepper` (+ `__item`, `__number`, `__label`), `.edminboost-setup-step`, `.edminboost-setup-wizard__footer`, `.edminboost-setup-review__*`, `.edminboost-preset-picker` (+ `--wizard` / `--full`, compact listbox + embedded top bar preview).
- Settings form: `.edminboost-fieldset`, `.edminboost-checkbox-row`, `.edminboost-checkbox-grid`.
- Command Center: `.edminboost-cc-wrap`, `.edminboost-cc-nav`, `.edminboost-cc-hero`, `.edminboost-cc-footer`.
- Billing: `.edminboost-billing-current`, `.edminboost-billing-plans`, `.edminboost-billing-plan` (+ `__badge`, `__header`, `__price`, `__features`, `__footer`, `__upgrade`; modifiers `.is-featured`, `.is-current`).
- Mapper: `.edminboost-mapper-layout`, `.edminboost-mapper-search`, `.edminboost-discovered-list`, `.edminboost-discovered-item` (+ `__toggle`, `__checkbox`, `__handle`, `__icon`), `.edminboost-topbar-canvas` (+ `.is-drag-over`), `.edminboost-topbar-item`, `.edminboost-item-drawer`, `.edminboost-topbar-summary`.
- Presets: `.edminboost-preset-grid`, `.edminboost-preset-card`, `.edminboost-role-matrix`.
- Appearance / behavior: `.edminboost-badge-preview`, `.edminboost-drawer-width-custom`, `.edminboost-drawer-width-preview__*` (width slider live preview), `.edminboost-animation-speed-picker` (+ `__toggle`, `__list`, `__option`, `__preview`, `__preview-drawer`; duration via `--edminboost-animation-preview-ms`).
- Menu Studio: `.edminboost-menu-studio-layout`, `.edminboost-menu-studio-panel`, `.edminboost-menu-canvas`, `.edminboost-menu-discovered-list`.
- Theme UI (settings markup): `.edminboost-theme-preset-colors`, `.edminboost-theme-color-swatches`, `.edminboost-theme-color-swatch`, `.edminboost-theme-custom-colors`, `.edminboost-theme-color-row`, `.edminboost-theme-preview` (+ `__bar`, `__badge`, `__accent`, `__muted`).
- Theme on plugin screens: `body.edminboost-theme-active .edminboost-wrap …` rules at end of `edminboost-admin.css` consume `--eb-*` tokens.
- Status modifiers: `.is-active`, `.is-inactive`, `.is-selected`, `.is-dragging`, `.is-default`.
- Responsive: feature list stacks at `782px`; persona grid and mapper layout stack at `960px`.

### Live admin bar + drawer (`admin/css/edminboost-command-center-bar.css`)

- Admin bar nodes scoped under `#wpadminbar` — not prefixed with `.edminboost-wrap`.
- Bar classes: `.edminboost-cc-bar-item`, `.edminboost-cc-bar-icon`, `.edminboost-cc-bar-drawer-trigger`, `.edminboost-cc-bar-badge`, `.edminboost-cc-bar-badge--dot|pill|accent`.
- Drawer shell (footer markup, not inside `#wpadminbar`): `.edminboost-cc-drawer`, `.edminboost-cc-drawer__panel--compact|standard|fullscreen|custom`, optional `.is-glass`, `.is-open`; `body.edminboost-cc-drawer-active` locks scroll.
- Enqueued by `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center_Bar::enqueue_assets()` when the bar is active (admin + front end when admin bar shows).

### Theme tokens (`admin/css/edminboost-themes.css`)

- Canonical CSS custom properties (`--eb-accent`, `--eb-surface`, `--eb-text`, `--eb-top-bar-bg`, `--eb-sidebar-bg`, drawer/badge/nav tokens, etc.) per preset (`body.edminboost-theme--{preset}`), mode (`edminboost-theme-mode--{mode}`), and font (`edminboost-theme-font--{font}`).
- Theme settings UI styles (swatches, color rows, preview card) live in this file near the bottom.
- Applies visual theme to core wp-admin `#wpadminbar` and `#adminmenu` when `body.edminboost-theme-active`; skips sidebar overrides when `body.edminboost-menu-studio-colors` is present.
- Loaded by `EDMINBOOST_Theme::enqueue_assets()` on all wp-admin when active; also enqueued on plugin screens as dependency of `edminboost-admin`.
- Custom hex overrides printed inline via `EDMINBOOST_Theme::print_custom_color_overrides()` when preset is `custom`.

### Menu colors (`admin/css/edminboost-admin-menu.css`)

- Loaded by `EDMINBOOST_Menu_Studio::enqueue_styles()` when Menu Studio is active and `use_colors` is on.
- Inline CSS vars from saved `menu_studio.colors` override sidebar parent/submenu/notification colors.

