## Mapper JS (`initMapper`)

Key elements: `#edminboost-mapper-form`, `#edminboost-topbar-items`, `#edminboost-topbar-canvas`, `#edminboost-discovered-list`, `#edminboost-topbar-hidden-inputs`, `#edminboost-item-drawer`, `#edminboost-plugin-search`, `#edminboost-drawer-preview`, `#edminboost-drawer-preview-wrap`.

- Canvas items: drag-reorder within canvas (`dragItem`, `effectAllowed: move`); keyed by `data-slug` + `data-anchor`.
- Discovered rows: drag-to-canvas (`dragPayload`, `effectAllowed: copy`); checkbox and row-click toggle add/remove (skipped when anchor is set).
- `setDiscoveredChecked()` keeps discovered `is-active` in sync with canvas membership for non-anchored slugs only.
- `syncHiddenInputs()` writes indexed hidden fields for `top_bar_items` (including `anchor`) before form submit.
- Custom link fields: `#edminboost-custom-link-path`, `#edminboost-custom-link-label`, `#edminboost-custom-link-anchor`; path may include `#fragment`.
- Item drawer field: `#edminboost-item-anchor`; preview button `#edminboost-drawer-preview` POSTs to `edminboost_cc_drawer_preview`, then calls `edminboostCcOpenDrawer`.
- Hidden marker input: `command_center[_layout_studio_save]` = `1` (Layout Studio partial only).
- Plugin search (`#edminboost-plugin-search`): filters discovered rows by visible label text.

## Behavior JS (`initBehavior`)

Runs on Appearance page (`#edminboost-appearance-form`). Key elements: `input[name*="[badge_style]"]`, `.edminboost-badge-preview__item`, `input[name*="[drawer_width]"]`, `#edminboost-drawer-width-custom`, `#edminboost_drawer_width_custom`, `#edminboost_drawer_width_preview_drawer`, `#edminboost-drawer-width-preview-caption`.

- Badge preview: shows one `.edminboost-badge-preview__item` matching the selected `badge_style` radio.
- Custom drawer width: toggles `#edminboost-drawer-width-custom` when `drawer_width=custom`; slider updates px label and preview drawer width (% of 1280px reference viewport); caption uses `edminboostData.strings.drawerWidthPreviewCaption`.
- Animation speed: screen-reader `#edminboost_animation_speed` stays the form source of truth; `#edminboost_animation_speed_toggle` opens `#edminboost-animation-speed-list` (listbox); option click updates select + plays toggle drawer preview; list open staggers `.edminboost-animation-speed-picker__preview-drawer` demos; Escape closes list.

## CC tab navigation JS (`initCommandCenterNav`)

- Intercepts `.edminboost-cc-nav__link` inside `.edminboost-wrap` (skips modified clicks / `_blank`).
- POSTs `page` to `edminboostData.ccNav` (`edminboost_load_cc_page`); replaces `.edminboost-wrap` with parsed response HTML.
- Updates `document.title`, `edminboostData.currentPage`, and `history.pushState` / `popstate`; calls `reinitEdminboostPage()`.
- Nav links use `data-edminboost-page` + `href`; loading state on `.edminboost-cc-nav` (`is-loading`, `aria-busy`) and wrap (`is-cc-loading`).
- Falls back to `window.location.assign( url )` on fetch failure.

## Layout preset picker JS (`initLayoutPresetPicker`)

Key elements: `#edminboost_layout_preset`, `#edminboost-layout-preset-picker`, `#edminboost_layout_preset_toggle`, `#edminboost-layout-preset-list`, `#edminboost-layout-preset-name`, `#edminboost-layout-preset-badge`, `#edminboost-layout-preset-desc`, `.edminboost-preset-picker .edminboost-overview-topbar-preview`, `#edminboost-overview-layout-preview`.

- Custom listbox mirrors theme preset picker UX; options grouped by `edminboostData.presetCategories`.
- `renderTopBarPreview( presetId )` rebuilds embedded mini admin bar (max 4 links + overflow) from resolved preset `top_bar_items`.
- `syncPresetCatalogFn` rebuilds grouped options when AJAX save returns refreshed `presets`.
- Used on setup wizard step 1, Layout Presets page, and Dashboard overview (`preset_picker_mode === 'overview'`); Presets page apply/duplicate/export stays in `initPresets`.

## Dashboard overview JS (`initDashboardOverview`)

Key elements: `#edminboost-dashboard-overview-form`, `#edminboost_dashboard_apply_preset`, `#edminboost-layout-preset-list`, `#edminboost-theme-preset-list`, `#edminboost-overview-topbar-links-picker`, `#edminboost_overview_topbar_links_toggle`, `#edminboost-overview-layout-preview`, `#edminboost-overview-theme-preview`, `#edminboost-overview-topbar-preview`.

- Layout preset option click sets `_apply_preset` hidden field and AJAX-saves; refreshes top bar previews and links list from `edminboostData.presets`.
- Theme preset option click AJAX-saves theme preset without full reload; updates theme preview swatches.
- Read-only top bar links picker toggles `#edminboost-overview-topbar-links-list` (closes on scroll via `initPickerCloseOnScroll`).
- Skips live `document.body` theme preview in `initTheme` when overview form is present.

## Setup wizard JS (`initSetupWizard`)

Key elements: `#edminboost-setup-wizard-form`, `.edminboost-setup-stepper__item`, `.edminboost-setup-step`, `#edminboost-setup-back`, `#edminboost-setup-next`, `#edminboost-setup-submit`, `#edminboost_wizard_apply_preset`, `#edminboost_wizard_default_preset`, `.edminboost-wizard-preset-radio`, `#edminboost-wizard-topbar-summary`.

- Four-step stepper toggles visible panels; Back/Next/Submit footer controls step navigation.
- Layout preset selection updates hidden `_apply_preset` / `default_preset` and re-renders top bar summary from `edminboostData.presets`.
- Final submit uses marker `command_center[_setup_wizard_save]` = `1` (sets `onboarding_completed` server-side when top bar items are saved).

## Theme JS (`initTheme`)

Key elements: hidden `#edminboost_theme_preset`, custom listbox `#edminboost-theme-preset-picker` (+ `#edminboost_theme_preset_toggle`, `#edminboost-theme-preset-list`), `#edminboost_theme_mode`, `#edminboost_theme_font`, `#edminboost-theme-preset-desc`, `#edminboost-theme-custom-colors`, `#edminboost-theme-preview`, custom fields `#edminboost_custom_{accent|surface|text|top|sidebar}` + matching `*_picker` inputs.

- Preset listbox toggles custom color pickers (`preset === 'custom'`); updates toggle swatches and description from `edminboostData.themePresets`.
- Live preview applies body classes (`edminboost-theme--*`, `edminboost-theme-mode--*`, `edminboost-theme-font--*`) and inline `--eb-*` vars on `document.body` and `#edminboost-theme-preview`.
- Color picker ↔ hex text sync; invalid hex leaves preview unchanged until valid.

## AJAX save (`initCommandCenterForms` / `initSettingsForm`)

- Intercepts `.edminboost-cc-form` and `.edminboost-settings-form` submit; POSTs `FormData` to `edminboostData.settingsSave.ajaxUrl` with action `edminboost_save_settings`.
- Uses nonce from form (`settings_fields()`); shows inline success/error notice; optional reload via `saveSettingsForm( form, { reload: true } )`.
- Success payload may include `presets`, `selected_preset`, `default_preset`, `setup_complete`, `message` — `applySettingsSaveResult()` syncs `edminboostData.presets` and reloads Dashboard via CC nav when wizard completes.

## Enqueuing

| Handle | File | When |
|--------|------|------|
| `edminboost-themes` | `admin/css/edminboost-themes.css` | `EDMINBOOST_Theme::is_active()` (all wp-admin when plugin enabled; also CC bar front end) |
| `edminboost-admin` | `admin/js/edminboost-admin.js`, `admin/css/edminboost-admin.css` | Plugin screens (`EDMINBOOST_Admin::is_plugin_screen()`); CSS depends on `edminboost-themes` |
| `edminboost-admin-menu` | `admin/css/edminboost-admin-menu.css` (+ inline colors) | Menu Studio active + `use_colors` |
| `edminboost-command-center-bar` (style) | `admin/css/edminboost-command-center-bar.css` | CC bar active or Layout Studio (`is_mapper_screen()`) |
| `edminboost-command-center-bar` (script) | `admin/js/edminboost-command-center-bar.js` | `has_drawer_items()` or Layout Studio |

Version: `EDMINBOOST_VERSION` for all handles.
